# Resilient Navigator

Modular, JSON-driven 2D drone mission simulator. See `plan.md` for architecture and `config/schema.md` for configuration.

## Setup

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Run (Hour 1 stub)

```bash
python main.py
python main.py --config path/to/mission.json
```
